        "title": "Definition of the arcsin",
        "text": "There is an angle $$\\frac{-\\pi}{2}$$ $$\\leq$$ $$\\theta$$ $$\\leq$$ $$\\frac{\\pi}{2}$$ such that $$\\arcsin(-\\sqrt{2}/2)=\\theta$$",
