        "title": "Definition of the sine",
        "text": "$$\\arcsin(-\\sqrt{2}/2)=\\theta$$ if and only if $$\\sin(\\theta)$$ $$=\\frac{\\left(-\\sqrt{2}\\right)}{2}$$",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "",
