        "title": "Possible $$\\theta$$",
        "text": "In the range $$\\frac{-\\pi}{2}$$ $$\\leq$$ $$\\theta$$ $$\\leq$$ $$\\frac{\\pi}{2}$$, $$\\sin(\\theta)$$ <0 for $$\\frac{-\\pi}{2}$$ $$\\leq$$ $$\\theta$$ < $$0$$",
